"""
SDC 2026 Kart CAN Simulator

This script simulates the kart's CAN responses for testing without real hardware.
It can be used with virtual CAN (vcan) on Linux to test the vehicle interface.

Usage:
  1. Set up virtual CAN:
     sudo modprobe vcan
     sudo ip link add dev vcan0 type vcan
     sudo ip link set up vcan0
  
  2. Run ros2_socketcan with vcan0:
     ros2 launch ros2_socketcan socket_can_bridge.launch.xml interface:=vcan0
  
  3. Run this simulator:
     python3 test_can_simulation.py
  
  4. Run your vehicle interface:
     ros2 launch my_vehicle_interface vehicle_interface.launch.xml
"""
^
